{"slug":"Aircraft-Carrier-CONSOLE-UPD-BETA-Ultimate-UI-V2-67665","_id":"691cb377798058ef47918923","title":"Ultimate UI V2","game":{"_id":"68aaff068843cab44a5c0852","gameId":5140123832,"name":"[Su-25] Aircraft Carrier [BETA] ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":5140123832},"features":"Since I really, really love this game, I’m posting my final script for it regardless of its popularity, because this is the limit of what I’m and game in principle capable of. Sure, I could add extra warning for missiles flying at you, track and hook all rockets, change their color if they’re heading your way and other such fine-tuning, but all the REALLY POWERFUL features are already implemented.\n\nPresenting: Ultimate UI v2 (FINAL):\n\nDestroy, win, and do whatever your heart desires. In this script you’ll find features like:\n\nESP – enable a beautiful ESP with convenient customization for planes and missiles, including a nice and clear trail that makes dodging very easy and lets you see the whole situation on the battlefield.\n\nTeleport – an insanely powerful feature that lets you stick to ANY enemy from behind and destroy them without putting yourself at risk at all (SUPER POWERFUL).\n\nAircraft modificator – engine modifiers that let you fly with the engine turned off (including with no fuel), increase its power, and enable ultra-maneuverability mode.\n\nFly – the most powerful feature, letting you enable controlled flight and move left, right, up, etc. at incredible speed (and more). It makes you feel like a god (like in Minecraft creative mode), easily fly around enemies, troll them, spam missiles at insane speed, etc. (MOST POWERFUL FUNCTION EVER).\n\nUI – a convenient and optimized UI with almost no bugs, with the ability to destroy/close it and more in the GUI tab.\n\nSincerely, your R-77","tags":["keyless","free","script","roblox","hub"],"sc